ef=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Callable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Callable</em></a>\n</td>\n<td>behavior is defined (always returns <code>nullptr</code>)\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function/target_type\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>target_type</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span></span> of the stored target <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/functional","title":"Function objects"},{"path":"utility/functional/function","title":"std::function"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::function<R(Args...)>::target","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Returns a pointer to the stored callable function target."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A pointer to the stored function if target_type() == typeid(T), otherwise a null pointer."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"target_type","note":"obtains the typeid of the stored target"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":218,"codeBlockCount":2}
